    // equal RATIOS of radius — so the pattern is PERIODIC in u, and sliding it
    // along u is a seamless infinite zoom. Rings emerge at the vanishing point
    // and swell outward for ever, each one thinner than the one ahead of it,
    // which is the whole parallax cue.
